Flat Paint Calculator
This C program estimates how much paint is needed for the walls and ceilings in a flat. For each room, enter its name, dimensions, and the paint colours. The program calculates the wall and ceiling areas and estimates the paint volume.
Calculation
The program assumes 1 liter covers 5 square meters.
- Wall area: 2 × length × height + 2 × width × height
- Ceiling area: length × width
- Paint needed: area ÷ 5
